    {
      "type": "text", "id": "subtitle", "x": 40, "y": 80, "width": 1400, "height": 50,
      "text": "L1 (in-process MemoryCache, microseconds)  +  L2 (Redis, milliseconds)  +  stampede protection (factory runs ONCE under concurrent miss)  +  tag-based invalidation.\nSource: CatalogService.Infrastructure/Caching/HybridProductCache.cs  ·  CatalogService.Application/Handlers/{GetProductById,UpdateProduct,ReserveStock}Handler.cs",
      "originalText": "L1 (in-process MemoryCache, microseconds)  +  L2 (Redis, milliseconds)  +  stampede protection (factory runs ONCE under concurrent miss)  +  tag-based invalidation.\nSource: CatalogService.Infrastructure/Caching/HybridProductCache.cs  ·  CatalogService.Application/Handlers/{GetProductById,UpdateProduct,ReserveStock}Handler.cs",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
